:''For more uses of "Sakura" see [[Sakura (disambiguation)]].''
'''Sakura Matou''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]] gains [[Soulstrike]], immunity to [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze]], and faster attack rate. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].

